    "short_description": "KFC France is a subsidiary of Yum! Brands and is part of the global KFC quick-service restaurant chain, specializing in chicken. Since entering the French market in 1991, KFC has expanded to over 300 locations, serving more than 200,000 customers daily. The brand has successfully transitioned from a niche offering to a mainstream favorite in France.\n\nKFC France features a variety of chicken-based menu items, with the bucket of chicken being a signature product. The company focuses on freshly prepared meals and has tailored its menu to suit local tastes, incorporating both traditional fried chicken and innovative, localized options. KFC France has positioned itself as a leader in the quick-service chicken category, leveraging its strong brand and a commitment to enhancing the customer experience.",
